        ink('15:7', '"if there be a needy man among you, ONE OF YOUR BROTHERS, within ONE OF YOUR GATES, in your land" — "one of your brothers" %s (one seat), "within one of your gates" %s (the formula\'s first seat of four), "in your land which the LORD your God gives you" %s; the parser\'s [1] at 15:7 %s' % (P('מאחד', 'אחיך'), P('באחד', 'שעריך', books=DT), P('בארצך', 'אשר', 'יהוה', 'אלהיך', 'נתן', 'לך'), PARSED[(15, 7)]))
        move('the Sifrei 116:4-8 (read whole at the reading); Bava Metzia 71a:3-4 (read whole at the docket); cold_run_ordinances (CALL) — OR.loan(priority_ladder) = %s' % (V(OR_LADDER),), "THE RANKS OF THE POOR A PRECEDENCE PARAMETER — 'among you' not others (116:4); 'one of your brothers' the hungrier, the father's brother before the mother's (116:5-6); 'within one of your gates' the city before another city (116:7); 'in your land' the Land before outside it, the door-to-door beggar owed nothing from the fund (116:8); Bava Metzia 71a:3-4 'the poor of your city first' and the Jew before the gentile even at a loss — THE LADDER ordinances.loan(priority_ladder) ALREADY HOLDS by CALL (my people before a gentile, the poor before the rich, your poor before your city's, your city's before another's)")
