        return out("the testimony and the expert (15:21) — priests suspected, Israelites not; the three laymen where there is no expert (Bekhorot 35b:1-37a:3); the non-expert who permits it pays a quarter of a small animal (Mishnah Bekhorot 4:4 — korach.the_gifts by CALL), the paid examiner disqualified (4:5): the non-expert who permits the firstling on his own word barred from it", ['barred_from_it'])
